# tests/fixtures/ holds compiler inputs and their expected outputs only —
# keep build artifacts (compiled executables, .s / .ir / .o, .dSYM) out of git.
# Allowlisted tracked types:
#   *.xc           — fixture sources
#   *.out          — corpus oracles (<name>.expected[.<arch>].out)
#   *.asm          — committed codegen reference output (regenerated by hand)
#   .unoracleable  — marker list
*
!*/
!*.xc
!*.out
!*.asm
!.unoracleable
!.gitignore
